  Word is a live weekly segment featuring some of the dopest poets in the s
 poken-word community — for raw interviews\, panel discussions\, and conv
 ersations that go beyond the page. Curated by Kierstin Tonic (Lady Renaiss
 ance)\, co-founder of Lyrics To Go and curator of community arts spaces\, 
