BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Soulful Poets: POETRY &amp\; MUSIC OPEN MIC NIGHT
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T200000
UID:8231bd420da18ce72dd99e2d029d68d6@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Soulful Poets is slated to be especially spectacular on Novemb
 er 7th because some of the most powerful poets I've ever seen will be grac
 ing the stage! This is a family friendly event where we will begin with a 
 poetry workshop at 5pm followed by the OPEN MIC at 6pm during which both m
 usicians and poets will be welcomed to the stage to share their work. Plen
 ty of delicious food and beverage options will be available throughout the
  event. 100% of Sips and Souls' net proceeds goes to the Human Rescue Soci
 ety Inc. to help support the fight against human trafficking Meet our feat
 ured poets! Thomas Pender is a poetic soul\, who weaves threads of love an
 d growth into his uplifting verses\, crafting a tapestry of positivity. Hi
 s words are like gentle whispers of encouragement written to inspire heart
 s to embrace the beauty of love and the transformative power of growth. Th
 rough his poetry\, he aims to illuminate the path of self-discovery and ce
 lebrate the journey towards becoming the best versions of ourselves. Each 
 stanza serves as a reminder that amidst life’s challenges\, love and gro
 wth are steadfast companions\, guiding his readers towards brighter horizo
 ns. Jewelz wit a Z is a NJ poet and spoken word artist who has featured ac
 ross the tri-state area since 2021. Her work has been published in Soup Ca
 n Magazine Issue # 6 and When Women Speak Poetry Anthology: Volumes 1 &amp
 \; 2. She was a finalist at the New Jeru Poetry Slam in Rahway in 2023 &am
 p\; 2024 and was a cast member for the spoken word/theater production\, Sn
 ippets\, in 2025. Her poetry primarily focuses on mental health\, empowerm
 ent\, nature and when necessary\, politics. Follow her Instagram @jewlz_wi
 t_a_z to see what she does next. Michael Hoff is an abstract artist and po
 et from South Jersey. He has self published five poetry books. When not wr
 iting\, Michael can be found getting lost in nature. See you there! THEME:
  OPEN MIC / FEATURES HOST: Ariana Merquri FEATURES: Thomas Pender\, Jewelz
  wit a Z\, Michael Hoff PRICE: FREE CONTACT: FB - Ariana Merquri
LOCATION:SIPS &amp\; SOULS CAFE\, 218 Hamilton Blvd South\, Plainfield\, N
 J 07080
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/soulful-poets-poetry-music-ope
 n-mic-night
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
