DESCRIPTION:It's time to LET FRESH FIRE FALL!&nbsp\; Let Fresh Fire Fall i
 s a Faith Based Open Mic that highlights Christian Poets.&nbsp\; It's curr
 ently a three month residency at the Cry Out Cave . 601 Doctor Martin Luth
 er King Junior Boulevard Basement Newark\, NJ 07102 Many thanks to&nbsp\;M
 ayowa Okubanjo (GODSENT) for the&nbsp\;opportunity! &nbsp\; The second nig
 ht is Friday November 13th\, 2026&nbsp\;@ 7:00PM .&nbsp\; Tickets&nbsp\;ar
 e $15 and can be purchased online here: LetFreshFireNov13.eventbrite.com &
 nbsp\; NO TICKETS SOLD AT THE DOOR .&nbsp\; Featuring for November 13th :&
 nbsp\;&nbsp\; Kendee Love &amp\;&nbsp\;AC Lightnin Event is open to all po
 ets regardless of religious background or none at all.&nbsp\; You'll hear 
 poetry from people of all backgrounds with underlying messages of&nbsp\; f
 aith\, hope\, love\, perseverance\, healing\, deliverance\, and joy among 
 other topics.&nbsp\; Our aim is to glorify God and be an inspiration and a
  light in the darkness. &nbsp\; Come with an open mind and heart to see an
 d hear how Christian Poets bring the poetic fire!&nbsp\; Poetry containing
  any profanity or explicit content will NOT be allowed . &nbsp\; The Open&
 nbsp\;Mic list is limited to ten (10) spots so come early to secure your s
 pot.&nbsp\; One (1) poem per person on the open mic list. &nbsp\; If time 
 permits\, any poets&nbsp\; on the Open Mic list&nbsp\;that wants to read a
 nother poem can. Save The Date For The Final Night : FRIDAY DECEMBER 11\, 
 2026&nbsp\;@ 7:00 PM&nbsp\; If you're interested in being a vendor\, pleas
 e call (646) 372-6230 &nbsp\; or email&nbsp\; PoetsWithPurpose@gmail.com .
 &nbsp\; I look forward to seeing you there!&nbsp\; THEME: Faith Based Open
  Mic&nbsp\; HOST: NOEL A. FIGUEROA POET\, AUTHOR\, BLOGGER FEATURES: KENDE
 E LOVE / AHE AC LIHENIN PRICE: Tickets&nbsp\;are $15 and can be purchased 
 online here: LetFreshFireFall.Eventbrite.com &nbsp\; CONTACT: If you're in
 terested in being a vendor\, please call&nbsp\; (646) 372-6230 &nbsp\;or e
 mail&nbsp\; PoetsWithPurpose@gmail.com .&nbsp\;
LOCATION:Cry Out Cave\, 601 Doctor Martin Luther King Junior Boulevard\, N
 ewark\, NJ\, 07102
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/let-fresh-fire-fall-nov
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
