BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:First Congregational Church: First OPEN MIC NIGHT
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270121T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270121T210000
UID:92c0bb7598bb946464b8f88f3b3ab8af@njpoetryevents.com
DESCRIPTION:Third Thursdays @First is your new home for the vibrant art co
 mmunity—a welcoming space where music\, visual art\, poetry\, and storyt
 elling come alive. First Congregational Church of Westfield invites musici
 ans\, artists\, poets\, and storytellers to join our new open mic series\,
  Third (3rd) Thursdays @ First. Inspired by the creative spirit of the cof
 fee and teahouses of the '90s\, this series is designed for artists and ar
 t lovers to connect\, share\, and celebrate creativity in all its forms. I
 f you are 16 or older\, come as you are and showcase your talent—whether
  through performance\, spoken word\, or visual art. Performers must sign u
 p in advance for a 10-minute slot (first come\, first served). We request 
 a $5 donation from attendees\; coffee\, tea\, and light snacks will be ser
 ved. All proceeds support future open mic nights and community outreach in
 itiatives\, helping to nurture and grow our local art scene. Visit fccofwe
 stfield.org/events to sign up! THEME: OPEN MIC / FEATURES HOST: First Cong
 regational Church of Westfield\, NJ FEATURES: Performers must sign up in a
 dvance for a 10-minute slot (first come\, first served). PRICE: $5 Donatio
 n from attendees\; coffee\, tea\, and light snacks will be served. CONTACT
 : Visit fccofwestfield.org/events to sign up! / FB - First Congregational 
 Church of Westfield\, NJ
LOCATION:First Congregational Church\, 125 Elmer Street\, Westfield\, NJ\,
  07090
URL:https://www.njpoetryevents.com/calendar/third-thursdays-first-open-mic
 -night-oct
X-SOURCE:NJ Poetry Events
END:VEVENT
